                <pb facs="0362" n="264" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg264"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cridler to Mr.
                            Goodnow.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August 8,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister Wu officially communicated to-day Imperial edict 5th instant, allowing
                    free cipher communication between ministers and Governments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cridler.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
